{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-mobile-gateway#feature-lan-api","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-mobile-gateway","commit":"7d2ecd8b7116fa3209756a47aaf52e29add31a22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-gateway 的功能「手机 RPC 接入」：手机可向带 token 门控的 /m/api 路由调用允许的 DSH 方法，路由转发到宿主共享 API。请求体受配置上限约束，未放行的方法会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/route.ts:66-92","src/route.ts:102-147"]}
