{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-mobile-gateway#feature-pairing","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-mobile-gateway","commit":"7d2ecd8b7116fa3209756a47aaf52e29add31a22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-gateway 的功能「扫码配对与令牌管理」：在本机管理页查看 LAN 地址和设备，为每个地址生成包含连接地址与 token 的二维码，也可生成新 token 并即时更新配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/admin.ts:125-149","src/admin.ts:168-187"]}
{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-mobile-gateway#feature-devices","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-mobile-gateway","commit":"7d2ecd8b7116fa3209756a47aaf52e29add31a22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-gateway 的功能「设备管理」：管理页展示访问设备记录，并支持按设备 ID 屏蔽或解除屏蔽；被屏蔽设备后续 API 请求会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/admin.ts:189-202","src/route.ts:69-78"]}
{"unit_id":"agent-mobile__dsh-mobile-gateway#caveat-token","repo":"agent-mobile/dsh-mobile-gateway","commit":"7d2ecd8b7116fa3209756a47aaf52e29add31a22","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-gateway 使用前须知：手机访问需要配置共享 token；管理页会显示 token 并生成配对二维码，因此应在本机打开管理页并妥善保管二维码与 token。（见 src/admin.ts:125-149）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/admin.ts:125-149"]}
